@startuml api-bet-dict
title GET /api/bet/dict — logic swimlanes

skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333

|Client|
start
:GET /api/bet/dict?codes=...;

|BetDictController|
if (**codes** missing / blank?) then (yes)
  :**ApiResponse::error** RET_MISSING_PARAM;
  |Client|
  :4xx JSON error;
  stop
endif
if (**codes** length > 512?) then (yes)
  :throw **ValidationException**;
  stop
endif
:Split **codes** by comma, trim, drop empties;
if (no tokens?) then (yes)
  :**ApiResponse::error** RET_MISSING_PARAM;
  |Client|
  :4xx JSON error;
  stop
endif

|MallDictionaryService|
:For each known code:\nmap to Backed Enum,\nbuild **{k, v}** rows\n(unknown codes ignored);

|BetDictController|
:Return **ApiResponse::ok**(data);

|Client|
:200 JSON;
stop

@enduml
